{"id": "t129-001", "text": "Caught up with Hannah over coffee. Her driving test is sometime next week and she's properly nervous, failed the last one on a roundabout. Her brother Eli passed first time which isn't helping. Remind me to text her good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-002", "text": "Long call with Mustafa. He and Farah are back from Lisbon, said the flight home was a nightmare, three hours delayed. They're already planning Japan over the summer. He's started a new role at the council too, which he hates so far. Farah's sister Adaeze is getting married in Lagos sometime in the spring so that's another long haul trip first. I should ask him for the name of that travel insurance place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Lagos", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long haul trip", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him for the name of that travel insurance place", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t129-003", "text": "Fatima's pregnant! Due early March. Morning sickness has been brutal apparently, she's barely eating. Her mum's moving in for a bit afterwards to help. Need to send her something nice.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Morning sickness", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something nice", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t129-005", "text": "Dinner with Anders and Krisztina. Their little boy Milan is getting christened in early December, we're invited. Krisztina's mum is flying over from Budapest the week before. Anders says he's dreading the speech, he's never done one in English. Their dog Rolo is going to the kennels that weekend. Remind me to ask what they'd like as a christening present, Krisztina said maybe a silver spoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting christened", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Budapest", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to the kennels", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask what they'd like as a christening present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "maybe a silver spoon", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t129-013", "text": "Miriam is so stressed about her bar exam in February. Hasn't slept properly in weeks. Her sister Mariam is coming to stay the weekend before to keep her sane. I should check in on her end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-014", "text": "Anan's back from Thailand. Two weeks visiting family in Chiang Mai, says his nan is doing much better. He brought me dried mango, absolute legend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Thailand", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing much better", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t129-015", "text": "Coffee with Aurelio. His daughter's ballet audition for the Royal Ballet School is in early February and he's more nervous than she is. They're driving down to London the day before and staying over.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ballet audition for the Royal Ballet School", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down to London", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t129-018", "text": "Jaya's flying to Toronto on Friday for her cousin's wedding. 9 hour flight, she hates flying. Back the following Monday. Her husband Milan isn't going, he's got a big work deadline, so she's flying solo with their two kids. Text her Friday morning before she leaves, and ask how the wedding went once she's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Toronto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates flying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big work deadline", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she leaves", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the wedding went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t129-019", "text": "Samir got his A level results back. AAB, missed his first choice by one grade. Clearing call was that afternoon and he got into Leeds instead, seems happy about it actually. His mum is relieved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A level results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Clearing call", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "happy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t129-020", "text": "Nikolai says Eva's expecting again! Baby number two, due sometime in late spring. Their eldest, Alana, is thrilled about being a big sister. Nikolai's already panicking about the car being too small.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in late spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled about being a big sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking about the car being too small", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t129-024", "text": "Lunch with Graham and Fiona. Fiona's sister Niamh is doing her midwifery finals end of the month and is terrified. Graham's taking a week off after the baby comes, sometime in March. Fiona craving pickled onions constantly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "midwifery finals", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking a week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "craving pickled onions", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t129-027", "text": "Krisztina rang. The trip to Iceland with her sisters got called off, the airline went bust. They're doing a weekend in the Lakes instead early next month. She sounded pretty flat about it. Give her a ring next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sisters", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend in the Lakes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Give her a ring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-028", "text": "Dalia says Sofia did loads better in her mocks than expected, mostly 6s and 7s. Graham's tutoring has really helped. Real exams are early summer. Sofia wants to do a sixth form course in art afterwards, Dalia isn't sure. Graham reckons she's got a real talent. Dalia's also off to Porto with the girls sometime in March, first trip without the kids in years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mocks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Real exams", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to do a sixth form course in art", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sure", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "got a real talent", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Porto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girls", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t129-029", "text": "Farah's starting maternity leave end of the month. Twins! Due early January, though the consultant says they'll probably come sooner. Mustafa building two cots this weekend. Remind me to ask Farah if she wants the old pram.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "maternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Twins", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "consultant", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sooner", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "building two cots", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Farah if she wants the old pram", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t129-030", "text": "Tadhg's dad had his heart op on Monday. Went fine, home a few days after. Tadhg's staying with him the rest of the week. Should drop round some food when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "heart op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with him", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-031", "text": "Talked to Zara about her trip. She's doing six weeks backpacking in South America over the summer, starting in Lima. Her girlfriend Jaya is joining for the last fortnight. Zara's nervous about the solo bit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "backpacking in South America", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joining", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the solo bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t129-032", "text": "Anders passed his citizenship test! Swedish passport no longer the only one. Krisztina is planning a little dinner the weekend after. Must bring wine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring wine", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t129-039", "text": "Baby boy for Fiona and Graham, born early this morning. Named him Tadhg after Graham's grandad. Fiona's exhausted but fine. Visit sometime next week once they're settled.", "spans": [{"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Baby boy", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "born", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Visit", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once they're settled", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-041", "text": "Niamh failed one module of her midwifery finals but can resit sometime in the spring. She's really down about it. Her flatmate Alana is keeping an eye on her. I must call her this weekend, properly not just a text.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "midwifery finals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "resit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-042", "text": "Need to book flights for Christmas sometime this week before they go up. Probably fly out the 20th, back the 2nd.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book flights for Christmas", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before they go up", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fly out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t129-043", "text": "Javier's back. Bogotá was amazing, his grandad's party went on till 4am. Pimienta ignored him for two days afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till 4am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pimienta", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t129-045", "text": "Adaeze passed!!! Fourth time lucky. She's driving to her mum's in Manchester next weekend, her first long drive, slightly terrified. Text her that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Manchester", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first long drive", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-046", "text": "Krisztina says Milan is sleeping through finally. She's back at work in early March, three days a week. Anders is going part time to cover the other two.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleeping through", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "three days a week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going part time", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t129-048", "text": "Dinner at Anan's. His wife Ming is pregnant, due late May, they told us over dessert. Her parents are flying in from Shanghai a week after the due date and staying the whole summer. Anan's slightly terrified about that. Ming's already off coffee and moaning about it. I should get them something small for the baby, maybe the little elephant toy she liked at the market.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "late May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Shanghai", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after the due date", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "off coffee", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them something small for the baby", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "maybe the little elephant toy she liked at the market", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t129-051", "text": "Jaya and Zara are back from Peru. Jaya got altitude sickness in Cusco, two days in bed. Zara says she's still coughing. Check in with Jaya end of the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Peru", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "altitude sickness", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coughing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with Jaya", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t129-052", "text": "Uncle Nikolai's retiring end of the month after 35 years at the railway. Big do at the social club the Saturday after. Mum wants us all to chip in for a watch.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Nikolai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 years at the railway", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Big do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for a watch", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t129-054", "text": "Farah's twins arrived a fortnight early, Eli and Eva. Small but healthy, home the next day. Mustafa's on paternity leave until early February. Farah's mum is staying the first month. Don't forget to drop the pram round.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "twins", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arrived", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight early", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until early February", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop the pram round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t129-055", "text": "Talked to Sofia, Dalia's daughter. She's got her grade 6 violin exam on the Tuesday and her school concert that evening. Busy day! She's not fussed about either, very chill kid.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 6 violin exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school concert", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not fussed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "chill kid", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t129-056", "text": "Hannah and her boyfriend Milan have booked a road trip round Scotland over Easter now she's got her licence. She wants recommendations for the Highlands. Send her that list from our trip.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "road trip round Scotland", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Easter", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "got her licence", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her that list from our trip", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t129-057", "text": "Beatriz is having a hard time settling in at ballet school, homesick and her feet are a mess. Aurelio's going down the weekend after next. Dalia's on the phone to her every night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beatriz", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "having a hard time settling in", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "feet are a mess", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going down", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}]}
{"id": "t129-060", "text": "Fiona's sister Niamh resat and passed! Qualified midwife now. Starting at the Royal Infirmary early January. Niamh says the first shifts will be nights, she's dreading it. Get a card for her and one for Fiona while I'm at it, it's her birthday on the 9th. She's been hinting at a new dressing gown.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "resat and passed", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Qualified midwife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starting at the Royal Infirmary", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get a card for her", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "one for Fiona", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "hinting at a new dressing gown", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
